  "description": "Variation of Condition 2 (approved drawings) to provide a minor material amendment to planning permission reference: \r2025/02935/FUL dated 23rd January 2026 for the \"Erection of rear roof extension, involving an increase in the ridge height by 150mm; erection of a rear extension at second floor level, over part of the existing back addition; installation of 3no. rooflights to the front roofslope; installation of bi-folding doors to the rear elevation at first floor level to replace existing window and external door, providing access to the proposed installation of a new external spiral black-painted metal staircase and platform to replace existing staircase from first floor level down to garden level; installation of a rooflight to the flat roof of the existing two storey rear extension; and replacement of all existing sash windows at first floor level with double-glazed uPVC windows.\"  Amendment sought is the aleration to the approved rear extension at second floor level over part of the existing back addition, by extending its length by approximately one metre."
